<title>USA: CUC International Inc earnings summary.</title>
<headline>CUC International Inc earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended April 30</p>
<p>			    1997			   1996</p>
<p> Shr (a)		    $0.17		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net			 70,473		   52,121</p>
<p> Revs		     624,671		  515,479</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 434,006		  396,665</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) Net income per share for 1997 quarter computed based upon &quot;if-converted&quot; method which excludes interest expenses attributable to 3 percent convertible subordinated notes issued Feb. 11, 1997, and includes the 14,966,004 weighted average shares (17,959,205 actual shares issued) in the total weighted average number of shares outstanding that would be issued if the notes were converted.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
